Z||000000||Fierochic88||09-26-2001||08:13 PM||||Alright everyone we have a topic!  It was a close race but in the end, Air Conditioning pulled ahead!  So we will host that one on October 6th and then in either December or January we will host a session on headliners  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">!!<P>So far I have the following people listed as coming and if they have offered to bring something it is in parentheses behind there name:<P>Dave Horst    \   Deviled Eggs, Rice Krispy <BR>Vonnie Houck  /   Drinks<BR>Fleabit Dog<BR>Joe Torma<BR>Ken Slish<BR>Lisa Levine<BR>Grinthock?<BR>Bruce Walters<BR>Spiff <BR>Bob Schlag<BR>Denny Lambert<BR>Jeff DeDay<BR>Bruce & Illyona Homeyard (Chili)<BR>Clint Nichols<BR>Nate Delp<BR>Mark & Karen Hoagland<BR>J.T. (Snafus87)   (Monkeybread)<BR>Brad (85 fiero GT)<BR>Twig & Stickman (Corn Bread)<BR>Denise <BR>Cory Hahn (Drinks)<BR>Joe Rebilas<BR>Reese Graves<P><BR>Looks like a good crew!  So if you would like to bring something, we gladly welcome more food and drinks!<P>We will be starting at 9 AM.<P>Directions are available at <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieropride.com</A>  under the events section!<BR>or just e-mail me at Fierochic88@hotmail.com<P>If you still want to sign up just let me know!<P>Can't wait to see everyone!<P>Also if anyone knows anyone who would like to donate door prizes let me know ASAP!<P>Jennifer<P>------------------<BR>IM Username:  FieroChic88<BR>Silver 1988 GT<BR>Silver 1986 2m4<BR>Cobalt Blue 85 GT<P>    <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/jenscar-sig1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
